  "solution": {
    "text": "Since, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#10233;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Similarly, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#38;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> ...(i)<br /><br />Given, |<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#10233;</mo><mo>|</mo><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math> ....(ii)<br /><br />Similarly, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></math> ...(iii)<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#38;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>|</mo><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></math>....(iv)<br /><br />On adding Eqs. (ii),(iii) and (iv), we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>|</mo><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#10233;</mo><msup><mrow><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math>...(v)[from Eqs. (i)]<br /><br />Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>|</mo><msup><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#10233;</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></math> [from Eqs. (i) and (v)]<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#10233;</mo><mo>|</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><msup><mo>|</mo><mi>&#160;</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>"
  }
